svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_award\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"></circle><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to Spooktober 8th Annual Visual Novel Jam</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4962910/pain-siphon\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_hina-mincho\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Pain Siphon\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5OTY5MTU1LnBuZw==/original/TS3PQK.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Pain Siphon</h1></div><div class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download ready\" id=\"view_html_game_9249928\"><div class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\" id=\"html_embed_4936473\"><div data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\"><button title=\"Enter fullscreen\" class=\"fullscreen_btn\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1790703660\"/></button><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/19461491/PainSiphon-1.0-web-build-upload/index.html?v=1790657924&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run visual novel</button></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h3><p>Your anger, your sadness, your fear, your grief...</p>\r\n<p>In a humble cabin deep in the forest, there is a man who can take it all away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All it takes is a touch of a healer for it to move from you to him.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>He will cry your very tears, scream your very screams,&nbsp;see what you see&nbsp;in your mind&#x27;s eye, and, at the end of it all...</p>\r\n<p>You are free, and the pain that once defined you lives as just another few inches of long, beautiful hair.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br></p></h3>\r\n<p><em>Pain Siphon</em> is a psychological horror&nbsp;kinetic visual novel about a magical healer who can absorb and process human suffering told from the point of view of his proxy and&nbsp;caretaker.</p>\r\n<ul><li>15-20 minute reading time</li><li>CG-heavy experience with rich visual storytelling through watercolor-style paintings</li><li>Immersive sound design and art&nbsp;takes you deep into the forests of rural Italy with actual recordings and illustrations&nbsp;of the area&#x27;s flora and fauna</li><li>Partial voice acting by the extremely talented J Cuevas, Persephone Randal, and Jett Barker</li><li>Bucket of eels</li></ul>\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center\"><a href=\"https://priro.pro/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Priro.pro Official Site</a></h4>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Credits</h3>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Direction, story,&nbsp; art, cinematography, and sound design&nbsp;by <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/princerosalium.bsky.social\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Prince Rosalium</a><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Environmental art by&nbsp;Dimitri DaMommio</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Music by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://jettbarker.itch.io/\">Jett Barker</a><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">UI Design by <a href=\"https://bird-king.itch.io/\">bird king</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Voice of Maurizio - <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/j-cuevas.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">J Cuevas</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Voice of Demetrio - <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/patternscreamer.bsky.social\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Persephone Randal</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">Voice of Renata - <a href=\"https://jettbarker.itch.io/\">Jett Barker</a></p>\r\n<p><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1